    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>Andrew D. Huberman, Ph.D.</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\"><br>Huberman Lab 新一期节目已上线： 真正幸福的艺术 | Arthur Brooks 博士 ( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/arthurbrooks\" dir=\"ltr\"><span>@arthurbrooks</span></a> <br>)<br><br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=0\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>0:00</span></span></a>  Arthur Brooks<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=160\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:40</span></span></a>  公共科学教育<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=258\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>4:18</span></span></a>  幸福、不幸福、工具：幸福的 3 种宏量营养素<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=464\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>7:44</span></span></a>  #1：享受、快乐；动物冲动与道德抱负；锻炼<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=1055\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>17:35</span></span></a>  赞助商：OurPlace 和 Helix Sleep<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=1241\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>20:41</span></span></a>  积极的自我反思、公开承诺与宣示道德抱负<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=1605\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>26:45</span></span></a>  道德差异、政治<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=2042\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>34:02</span></span></a>  工具：适当的休闲与价值观；充实<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=2507\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>41:47</span></span></a>  深化关系与共同承受苦难<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=2930\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>48:50</span></span></a>  赞助商：AG1<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=3008\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>50:08</span></span></a>  #2：满足感、奋斗与目标<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=3392\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>56:32</span></span></a>  奋斗与休闲，高成就者；随年龄增长更幸福，退休<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=3806\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:03:26</span></span></a>  #3：意义、遗憾、偶像<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=4210\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:10:10</span></span></a>  赞助商：David<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=4280\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:11:20</span></span></a>  遗憾，工具：识别你的偶像，四种偶像<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=5369\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:29:29</span></span></a>  恶习与美德，抵制恶习与追求道德理想<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=5750\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:35:50</span></span></a>  钦佩与独特的自我表达；英雄<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=6283\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:44:43</span></span></a>  教学与分享知识<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=6595\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:49:55</span></span></a>  赞助商：LMNT<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=6675\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:51:15</span></span></a>  偶像与享乐跑步机、成瘾行为与量化<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=7106\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:58:26</span></span></a>  生命意义与基本体验，工具：打破科技成瘾<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=7622\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:07:02</span></span></a>  信仰、渐进探索、对神性的渴望<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=7940\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:12:20</span></span></a>  无神论、死亡与虚无；先实践后感受<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=8298\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:18:18</span></span></a>  践行信仰、衰老与深化信仰；祷告实践<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=8813\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:26:53</span></span></a>  配偶关系；成瘾、工作狂<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=9306\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:35:06</span></span></a>  你生命的意义，工具：意义的三个问题<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=9805\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:43:25</span></span></a>  致谢、朝圣之旅<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107?t=10043\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:47:23</span></span></a>  零成本支持、YouTube、Spotify 和 Apple 关注、评论与反馈、赞助商、Protocols 书籍、社交媒体、神经网络通讯<br><br>包含付费合作内容 。</div><div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2099332973967650816/img/zW0008R9h9wrIP0N.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div></article><hr/><h3>热门回复</h3><div class=\"tw-replies\"><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@TCL CSOT</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 69 · 💬 12</span><p>Finally, OLED that works for work.<br><br>Powered by TCL CSOT’s IJP OLED technology, the Lenovo ThinkVisionP27UL-40 Monitor delivers UHD clarity, precise colour and sharper text—with Thunderbolt™ 4 connectivity for a cleaner workspace.<br><br>At its core is TCL CSOT’s IJP OLED UHD 120Hz</p></div><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@She’s For The Boys</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 5 · 💬 0</span><p>幸福的三大营养素听起来比又一个末日刷屏特辑要好得多。这个得保存下来。</p></div><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Sophia McIntosh</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 3 · 💬 0</span><p>一直很想在这个播客上听到他！现在正在听</p></div><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Ashes of Jedha</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 2 · 💬 0</span><p>听起来很深奥。与其自我反思，我还不如继续刷着末日信息划过这条帖子，哈哈。<br><br>不。我还是会听的。也许能变得更好一点。</p></div><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Seth McKenzie</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 0 · 💬 1</span><p>我从中受益匪浅。谢谢你们两位！</p></div></div>",
    "pageContent": "Andrew D. Huberman, Ph.D.: Huberman Lab 新一期节目已上线： 真正幸福的艺术 | Arthur Brooks 博士 ( @arthurbrooks ) 0:00 Arthur Brooks 2:40 公共科学教育 4:18 幸福、不幸福、工具：幸福的 3 种宏量营养素 7:44 #1：享受、快乐；动物冲动与道德抱负；锻炼 17:35 赞助商：OurPlace 和 Helix Sleep 20:41 积极的自我反思、公开承诺与宣示道德抱负 26:45 道德差异、政治 34:02 工具：适当的休闲与价值观；充实 41:47 深化关系与共同承受苦难 48:50 赞助商：AG1 50:08 #2：满足感、奋斗与目标 56:32 奋斗与休闲，高成就者；随年龄增长更幸福，退休 1:03:26 #3：意义、遗憾、偶像 1:10:10 赞助商：David 1:11:20 遗憾，工具：识别你的偶像，四种偶像 1:29:29 恶习与美德，抵制恶习与追求道德理想 1:35:50 钦佩与独特的自我表达；英雄 1:44:43 教学与分享知识 1:49:55 赞助商：LMNT 1:51:15 偶像与享乐跑步机、成瘾行为与量化 1:58:26 生命意义与基本体验，工具：打破科技成瘾 2:07:02 信仰、渐进探索、对神性的渴望 2:12:20 无神论、死亡与虚无；先实践后感受 2:18:18 践行信仰、衰老与深化信仰；祷告实践 2:26:53 配偶关系；成瘾、工作狂 2:35:06 你生命的意义，工具：意义的三个问题 2:43:25 致谢、朝圣之旅 2:47:23 零成本支持、YouTube、Spotify 和 Apple 关注、评论与反馈、赞助商、Protocols 书籍、社交媒体、神经网络通讯 包含付费合作内容 。\n[![视频](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2099332973967650816/img/zW0008R9h9wrIP0N.jpg)](https://x.com/hubermanlab/status/2099498403889906107)\n---\n热门回复 (共 5 条):\n@TCL CSOT (♥ 69 · 💬 12):\nFinally, OLED that works for work.\n\nPowered by TCL CSOT’s IJP OLED technology, the Lenovo ThinkVisionP27UL-40 Monitor delivers UHD clarity, precise colour and sharper text—with Thunderbolt™ 4 connectivity for a cleaner workspace.\n\nAt its core is TCL CSOT’s IJP OLED UHD 120Hz\n\n@She’s For The Boys (♥ 5 · 💬 0):\n幸福的三大营养素听起来比又一个末日刷屏特辑要好得多。这个得保存下来。\n\n@Sophia McIntosh (♥ 3 · 💬 0):\n一直很想在这个播客上听到他！现在正在听\n\n@Ashes of Jedha (♥ 2 · 💬 0):\n听起来很深奥。与其自我反思，我还不如继续刷着末日信息划过这条帖子，哈哈。\n\n不。我还是会听的。也许能变得更好一点。\n\n@Seth McKenzie (♥ 0 · 💬 1):\n我从中受益匪浅。谢谢你们两位！\n"
